      "content": "It's so much easier to let the weight of their sacrifices crush you than to face the reality of your own worth. Please know that your perceived failure is a heavy burden you've placed on yourself, and it doesn't define your value. You are not a stain; you are a person who is struggling, and that struggle is a perfect reason to seek kindness, especially from yourself.",
